1 0 0 1 54 546 Tm (Say that Vire is a new language with its own syntax and a Windows runner. Say that) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 532 Tm (programs are .vire files. Say that the interesting application is a window written) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 518 Tm (only in Vire, and that files stay in the program folder. Say that the license is MIT.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 504 Tm (Do not say that it replaces every other language. Do not say that it cannot be abused) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 490 Tm (if a person rewrites the runner. Do not paste a drive letter from a private machine) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 476 Tm (into the post. Link the repository, and let GUIDE.md do the teaching. The image that) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 462 Tm (accompanies the post should show a single window and a page of Vire source, not a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 448 Tm (collage of other languages' logos. The language spent the whole session climbing out) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 434 Tm (of other languages. The picture should not put it back.) Tj
